  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Is archaeology a good career in India? It is a good career for a small group who love fieldwork and can live with thin hiring, and a poor plan for anyone who needs a quick, certain job.</strong>
    The government ladder is narrow, and the money is modest unless you add a skill that sells outside the dig. The people who do well build a <strong>high-value skill portfolio</strong> next to their field knowledge: mapping, 3D recording, a lab method, clear writing. Those are the decisions that unlock high income opportunities and an earlier path to financial freedom.
  </p>

