      <li><strong>Lead with the routes that scale: GIS and 3D documentation, heritage consulting, archaeological science, conservation and heritage tourism. Treat ASI posts, state posts, project contracts and NET-led teaching as Not so scalable and keep a second skill running.</strong></li>
